[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955822828","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107209#issuecomment-2955822828","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107209","id":2955822828,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wLkbs","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-09T13:37:55Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T13:37:55Z","body":"Ok, finished. I had to introduce some config structs that keep data between methods. I planned to do that anyway, to better organize all the static properties. I will do a follow-up PR for remaining config.\r\nNote that options are not handled in the order they are defined. I reordered handling to better group the defines. The order displayed in help should be the same as before.\r\nAlso C++20 would be handy to apply some further improvements.\r\n\r\nAnother thing is that registering launch options allows to also register them in the modules. This will allow to move some code out of main to their respective module, and also allows showing some options from modules that weren't in help. I'll do that in another follow-up.\r\n\r\nI also unified handling of option parameters. If an option expects next argument, it will ignore arguments starting with `-`. So now `--max-fps --headless` will properly result in an error, instead of trying to parse `--headless` as FPS value.\r\n\r\nI also found a few options not displayed in help. I registered them as hidden, so they still not show in help, but get handled like other options","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955822828/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2958793026","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107209#issuecomment-2958793026","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107209","id":2958793026,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wW5lC","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-10T11:27:58Z","updated_at":"2025